  "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
  "text": "Sol has brought his unfinished draft to the gathering.\n\nThe seed is planted. Its roots can reach the soil now.\n\nFull screen is unavailable. You can keep playing here.\n\nThe times between the later part of the day and night.\n\nSol places the same spare tile where you directed him.\n\nA rough sound made as something rubs across a surface.\n\nThe invited guests have arrived. Pip can welcome them.\n\nThe parts of the body between the shoulders and hands.\n\nPip waits with Grandma while the invited guests arrive\n\nA device that uses light to show pictures on a screen.\n\nPut something into a protected or close-fitting place.\n\nStep onto the bank before releasing a supporting rope.\n\nLook carefully to find out whether something is right.\n\nFor more time; no longer means something has stopped.\n\nWould you tell everyone about Rina’s thank-you visit?\n\nRelease to place. Click the ground or a deck to walk.\n\nA clear, high sound made by blowing through the lips.\n\nRepair the footbridge. Read the note to find out how.\n\nAsk Mara for a copy of her story before Pip reads it.\n\nIntroduces something different from what came before.\n\nA hand closed tightly with its fingers curled inward.\n\nLines or shapes made by bending material over itself.\n\nThe setting in which people or story characters live.\n\nLet other people hear, use or take part in something.\n\nPossessing, experiencing or taking part in something.\n\nBring the last boat alongside. Mara is still on duty.\n\nAble to do something; cannot means not able to do it.\n\nA room or building where things are made or repaired.\n\nRina gave permission. Bring this intact tile to Sol.\n\nConnects a part, quality, or belonging to something.\n\nYou direct the bridge repair · Pip waits on the bank\n\nPress and fold dough to make it smooth and stretchy.",
  "textSha256": "595d6c41ef4a3c94c23832cccfbcb4e3910fcdef307eaa418115454f354ba5f7",
